# Local generation works with separately installed official fonts.
# Vercel/Git builds restore the encrypted fonts using this build-only secret.
# Set it in Vercel as a Secret; never use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix or commit its value.
GULBAHAR_FONT_KEY=
# Protect the entire production deployment with your corporate identity provider.
# Do not put secrets or licensed font files in NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables or public/.
